# Tests verify correctness; they do not define the solution. A change to a test, a golden, a scenario or a
# manual checklist, or to the policy that protects them, is reviewed by a maintainer (TESTING.md section 6.2,
# ADR 0025). Replace the owner with a team handle when one exists; GitHub applies the last matching pattern.

# --- Tests, goldens, scenarios, manual checklists -------------------------------------------------------------
# These mirror the test sources and goldens of .githooks/lib/classify-diff.awk.
**/testdata/**                 @jrandolf
**/test/**                     @jrandolf
**/tests/**                    @jrandolf
**/*_test.*                    @jrandolf
**/test-*.sh                   @jrandolf
**/test.sh                     @jrandolf
**/*.tftest.hcl                @jrandolf
/sim/scenarios/**              @jrandolf
**/*.golden                    @jrandolf
**/*.golden.*                  @jrandolf
**/golden/**                   @jrandolf
**/goldens/**                  @jrandolf
**/__snapshots__/**            @jrandolf
**/*.snap                      @jrandolf
/docs/testing/manual/**        @jrandolf

# --- The policy and the tooling that enforces it ---------------------------------------------------------------
/TESTING.md                    @jrandolf
/AGENTS.md                     @jrandolf
/CLAUDE.md                     @jrandolf
/.github/CODEOWNERS            @jrandolf
/.github/workflows/**          @jrandolf
**/BUILD.bazel                @jrandolf
**/BUILD                      @jrandolf
/.githooks/**                  @jrandolf
/tools/ci/**                   @jrandolf
/.golangci.yml                 @jrandolf
/deny.toml                     @jrandolf
/.gitleaks.toml                @jrandolf
/.bazelrc                      @jrandolf
/bazel/tiers.bzl               @jrandolf
/bazel/tier_check.bzl          @jrandolf
